GLiNER2.5 Small Android host sample

The sparse decoder is a Kotlin port of the gliner2 2.0.0 shared-pool NER path
from Fastino AI's GLiNER2 project, licensed under Apache License 2.0.
Changes include Kotlin float32 tensor operations, safetensors loading,
graph-contract validation and Java/Python Unicode-offset adaptation.

The tokenizer follows the published DeBERTa-v3 tokenizer JSON contract.
The original model and host assets are downloaded unchanged from
litert-community/GLiNER2.5-Small-LiteRT at revision
8c4759df4feb91497e7f49212abf056d79789cac.

Gradle wrapper files retain their upstream Apache License 2.0 headers.
Retained model/runtime/encoder licenses are under licenses/.
